@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title Evidence-bounded class and function metrics

left to right direction

component "CodePropertyGraph" as CPG #DBE4FF
component "Nominal ownership\nClass / Struct / Enum" as OWNER #E9ECEF
component "Resolved field evidence\nFieldRead / FieldWrite + Reference" as FIELD #FFE8CC
component "Resolved call graph\ncaller -> callee" as CALL #C3FAE8
component "Method-field graph" as MFG #FFF3BF
component "CK + LCOM1-5" as CK #E5DBFF
component "Function CPG scope\n(no nested functions)" as SCOPE #D3F9D8
component "Halstead + cyclomatic\n+ cognitive + MI" as FUNCTION #FFD8A8

CPG --> OWNER : declaration scope\nand unique sibling Impl
CPG --> FIELD : typed DFG/reference edges
CPG --> CALL : Call target / call edge
OWNER --> MFG : methods and fields
FIELD --> MFG : method -- access -- field
CALL --> MFG : internal method calls
MFG --> CK : <latex>LCOM_1,\ldots,LCOM_5</latex>
CALL --> CK : RFC and CBO
OWNER --> CK : WMC, DIT, NOC

CPG --> SCOPE : semantic node kinds\nand source ranges
SCOPE --> FUNCTION : operator / operand classes\ncontrol nesting / comment spans

note bottom of MFG
  An access is admitted only when the same node has:
  * a Reference to an owned Field; and
  * a typed FieldRead or FieldWrite relation.
  Unresolved member spelling contributes no cohesion edge.
end note

note bottom of CK
  Stable NodeId ordering
  Feature-free and read-only
  Finite graph-bounded traversal
end note

note bottom of FUNCTION
  No source reparse
  MI is clamped to <latex>[0,100]</latex>
  Counts remain inspectable
end note

legend bottom
|= Color |= Concept |
|<#DBE4FF>| shared CPG evidence |
|<#E9ECEF>| nominal ownership policy |
|<#FFE8CC>| resolved field access |
|<#C3FAE8>| resolved invocation |
|<#FFF3BF>| method-field topology |
|<#E5DBFF>| class-level report |
|<#D3F9D8>| bounded function scope |
|<#FFD8A8>| function-level report |
endlegend
@enduml
